  "document": "George Wallace (film)\nGeorge Wallace is a 1997 television film starring Gary Sinise as George Wallace, the former Governor of Alabama. It was directed by John Frankenheimer, who won an Emmy award for it; Sinise and Mare Winningham also won Emmys for their performances. The film was based on the 1996 biography \"Wallace : The Classic Portrait of Alabama Governor George Wallace\" by Marshall Frady, who also co-wrote the teleplay."
